Phase 5 GOAL 1 — job queue live demo (2026-10-04)

SETUP: job_queue table (migration-phase5-hardening.sql) + queue worker
(5s tick, at-most-once claim via status flip) + handlers registry.

DEMO 1 — dead-letter visible:
  enqueued demo:no-handler (no handler registered)
  → next tick: status=dead, last_error="no handler registered for queue
    'demo:no-handler'", /api/v1/jobs counts {dead: 1}

DEMO 2 — retry with backoff:
  enqueued grow:publish (max_attempts 2, slot with bogus approval → handler
  throws 'approval not approved — deny-by-default')
  → attempt 1 fail → queued w/ 30s backoff
  → attempt 2 fail → DEAD (attempts: 2, last_error honest)
  → /api/v1/jobs shows the DLQ row + counts

DEMO 3 — manual retry:
  POST /api/v1/jobs/<id>/retry → OK — status queued (attempts reset 0)

Verdict: PASS — a failed job retries with backoff, then surfaces visibly
in /api/v1/jobs + a feed event. Nothing fails silently.
